    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]",
    "content" : "cement paste samples of approx. 20 × 15 × 3 mm 3 that were cut from the paste cylinders. All pressure plate samples were vacuum saturated before the tests."
  }, {
